                                "sense_id": "8b00af5b-f163-379b-9875-b1e266ed7653",
                                "text": "ProPublica was working on this story before UHC’s CEO got Luigied:"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "64948036-c59e-49ce-b0d6-161d2c8ee5aa",
                                "sense_id": "8b00af5b-f163-379b-9875-b1e266ed7653",
                                "text": "I mean, some probably think that Luiging people might be fine?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6eae2056-1a94-42b8-84be-476fb041124e",
                                "sense_id": "8b00af5b-f163-379b-9875-b1e266ed7653",
                                "text": "So uh, basically, there's some more CEOs that need to be Luigied"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d86ff2d-ba23-42f6-b87c-1719a56ce539",
                                "sense_id": "8b00af5b-f163-379b-9875-b1e266ed7653",
                                "text": "Do you think if someone was going to \"Luigi him\", a kid on his shoulders would stop it?"
                            }
                        ]
